---
import LegalLayout from '~/layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
---

<LegalLayout title="About & FAQ">
  <style>
    .faq-item {
      margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
    }
    .faq-item h3 {
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #ffcc00;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
    .faq-item p {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.8;
      color: #888899;
    }
    .about-intro {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      line-height: 1.9;
      color: #888899;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }
    .about-intro strong {
      color: #e8e8ee;
    }
    .section-label {
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #00e5ff;
      margin: 2.5rem 0 1.25rem;
    }
  </style>

  <p class="about-intro">
    <strong>Skill Check</strong> is a daily trivia card game built for gaming enthusiasts. Every day at midnight UTC, a new
    themed challenge drops — covering everything from retro classics to modern hits. Collect cards, discover synergies, climb
    the leaderboard, and build your collection. Made by
    <a href="mailto:support@ki10games.com">Ki10 Games</a>.
  </p>

  <hr />

  <h2 class="section-label">FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS</h2>

  <div class="faq-item">
    <h3>What is the daily challenge?</h3>
    <p>
      Every day we release a new themed set of trivia cards. All players get the same cards and questions, so scores are
      directly comparable. The challenge resets at midnight UTC.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="faq-item">
    <h3>Is Skill Check free to play?</h3>
    <p>
      Yes. The core daily challenge is completely free. Premium is an optional one-time purchase that unlocks the
      archive (play any past daily), cloud saves, replay mode, and the ability to submit theme ideas.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="faq-item">
    <h3>How do streaks work?</h3>
    <p>
      Play the daily challenge every day to build your streak. Your streak counter shows on the leaderboard and your
      profile. Miss a day and it resets to zero. Streaks are tracked in UTC time.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="faq-item">
    <h3>What are synergies?</h3>
    <p>
      When you slot cards from the same gaming franchise or theme into the console together, they activate a synergy —
      giving you a score multiplier. Part of the strategy is figuring out which cards combine. There are dozens of
      hidden synergies to discover.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="faq-item">
    <h3>How do I save my progress across devices?</h3>
    <p>
      Create a free account using your email. Your scores, collection, streaks, and cosmetics will sync automatically
      across any device you log into. Premium users also get full cloud save backup.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="faq-item">
    <h3>What is the Collection / Museum?</h3>
    <p>
      Every card you encounter gets added to your collection. Answer all trivia correctly for a card and it becomes
      "Mastered" — shown with a special shine effect. Your goal: master every card in the game.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="faq-item">
    <h3>Can I submit theme ideas?</h3>
    <p>
      Premium members can submit one theme idea per month. If your theme is selected for a daily challenge, you'll get a
      notification, a special "Trendsetter" title, and your name displayed to all players that day.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="faq-item">
    <h3>What is the Archive?</h3>
    <p>
      The Archive lets premium members play any past daily challenge. Scores from archive runs are tracked separately
      and don't affect the main daily leaderboard. It's a great way to catch up on themes you missed.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="faq-item">
    <h3>How are leaderboard scores calculated?</h3>
    <p>
      Your score is based on correct answers (trivia points), answer speed (speed bonus), and whether you maintained a
      perfect run (no wrong answers). Synergy multipliers also boost your score. The leaderboard shows today's scores,
      all-time bests, and longest active streaks.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="faq-item">
    <h3>I found a bug or have feedback</h3>
    <p>
      Use the "Send Feedback" button in the game's settings menu — it goes straight to our development team. You can
      also email <a href="mailto:support@ki10games.com">support@ki10games.com</a>.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="faq-item">
    <h3>What platforms does Skill Check run on?</h3>
    <p>
      Skill Check runs in any modern web browser on desktop or mobile. No download required — just visit
      <a href="https://skillcheckgame.com">skillcheckgame.com</a> and play.
    </p>
  </div>
</LegalLayout>
